SUMMARY:West Art Welcomes Cris Jacobs and Seth Walker!
DESCRIPTION:West Art is excited to announce that Cris Jacobs and Seth Walke
 r are coming to town! Seth Walker is a revered modern Americana artist\; a
  three dimensional talent combining a gift for melody and lyric alongside 
 a rich\, Gospel-drenched\, Southern-inflected voice with a true blue knack
  for getting around on the guitar. Currently residing in Asheville after s
 tints living in Nashville\, New Orleans and Austin\, he’s used those exp
 eriences wisely\, soaking up the sounds and absorbing the musical lineage 
 of these varied places. From Baltimore comes Cris Jacobs — an unexpected
 ly gritty soul-blues singer and guitarist with outlaw country ethos. Blend
 ing a variety of musical traditions\, Jacobs creates a distinctive voice a
 nd sound of his own punctuated by emotive songwriting and explosive guitar
  playing. Equally at home playing heartfelt Americana ballads or funky blu
 es rockers\, Jacobs is known for his mesmerizing live shows\, where his im
 provisational guitar playing\, powerhouse band\, and deep reservoir of son
 gs make each night a unique experience. These two are ready to make their 
 mark at West Art\, so join us for an evening of special moments\, plenty o
 f stories\, and songs that leave you feeling like you're exactly where you
  need to be. What to expect at the show: >> Doors will open at 6:30 pm. Th
 e show will start at 7:30 pm. >> Tickets are $30 in advance\, and $35 at t
 he door if not sold out. As always\, we’re proud to present an all-ages 
 show! >> Parking is available on the street around F&M College. We suggest
  finding a spot on the park side of Buchanan Ave\, Race Ave\, or College A
 ve (North of Buchanan). Thank you for helping us be good neighbors! >> For
 mat: This will be a seated show in The Sanctuary. Our space is ADA accessi
 ble\, and we will do our best to accommodate any specific needs. >>The Art
  Bar is open daily from 7 am to 10 pm with a full espresso menu\, beer\, w
 ine\, cocktails\, N/A drinks\, and tasty bites from local bakeries. Come s
 ettle in before the show\, and linger after for a nightcap! >> Please note
  that all ticket sales are final. Tickets purchased using digital payment 
 methods include a small service fee. Cash purchases at the door are not su
 bject to this fee. Thank you for supporting great music!\n\nPrice: Not sup
 plied by this calendar\; check event details\n\nSchedule listed: Nov 13\, 
